Clinical entities that can result in GOO generally are categorized into benign and malignant groups. In the past, peptic ulcer
disease (PUD) was the most common cause of GOO, but currently, 50-80% of GOOs are due to malignancies such as
pylorus adenocarcinoma, lymphoma and gastrointestinal stromal tumor (GIST).

Benign causes of GOO include pancreatic pseudocysts, gastric varices, infections such as tuberculosis, and rarely gall
stones.

At this level, no pancreatic or hepatic lesion is seen. Cancer of the stomach would have given an obstruction in the upper
parts if it involves the pylorus. Besides, this might be the underlying cause of the CT scan findings, not the interpretation.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2025','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","supporting_pages":[38],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-dffd0a201f00","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"9520b71514cc5c8d6457","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":38,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"d6e149eff49f81aff9df","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":524,"source_qid":"528"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
