liver. CT scanning of the liver suggests the tumor to be malignant. Which one of the
following could be the most likely diagnosis?','{"A":"OA. Hepatoma.","B":"B. Metastasis from colon cancer.","C":"C. Metastasis from stomach cancer.","D":"D. Metastasis from breast cancer.","E":"E. Metastasis from ovarian cancer."}','A','Approximately 90% of malignant liver tumors are metastases from other primary
