pain. Upon examination, he had a blood pressure of 80/60mmHg, pulse rate of 110 bpm,
respiratory rate of 22 breaths per minute, and temperature of 38.9°C. The right upper quadrant
is tender to palpation. Laboratory studies reveal high white cell count and mildly elevated
bilirubin. Based on the findings, you suspect acute cholangitis as the diagnosis. Which one of
the following organisms is most likely to have caused sepsis?',NULL,'D','Acute cholangitis is a clinical syndrome characterized by fever, abdominal pain, and jaundice,
developing due to stasis and infection in the biliary tract. It can rapidly progress to sepsis. Biliary
system obstruction is the most common predisposing factor.

Culture of bile, ductal stones, and blocked biliary stents are positive in over 90% of cases,
yielding a mixed growth of gram-negative and gram-positive bacteria. The most common
bacteria isolated have a colonic origin.

Escherichia coli is the primary bacterium isolated (25 to 50%), followed by Klebsiella (15-20%)
and Enterobacter species (5-10%). Enterococcus species (e.g., enterococcus fecalis) are the
most common gram-positive bacteria (10-20%).

Anaerobes, such as Bacteroides and Clostridia, are usually present as isolated pathogens, but
they are rarely the sole infecting organisms, and it is unclear if they play a role in acute
cholangitis.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2025','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","supporting_pages":[64],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-6cf6d51ef140","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"ba4b1509fb29f2ded3ad","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":64,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"c1e5925fa6024b4e6f22","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GIT 41-75.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GIT 41-75.pdf","source_page":54,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
