hemochromatosis?','{"A":"A. Supraventricular tachyacardias.","B":"OB. Congestive heart failure.","C":"C. Atrial fibrillation.","D":"D. Atrial flutter.","E":"E. Atrioventricular (AV) block."}','B','The most common cardiac manifestation of hemochromatosis is congestive heart failure.
