s, consistent with an (internal) hemorrhoid. The presence of pain suggests acute thrombosis.\n(Option B) External hemorrhoid has a different appearance.\n\n(Option C) Although hemorrhoids can be associated with rectal carcinoma, the lesion itself is not a carcinoma. Moreover, a carcinoma this large would have been\nassociated with more pronounced systemic and local symptoms.\n\n(Option D) It is important to note that for every anorectal lesion, a thorough investigation should be conducted in an attempt to exclude serious underlying pathologies\nsuch as inflammatory bowel disease or malignancies.\n\n(Option E) Perianal abscesses present with painful and tender red perianal swelling and induration, not a lesion protruding out of the anus.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","duration","hypertension","management","pregnan"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"316bc4797f4773d72aefcfc1a7fd877cc1b0d05c","duplicate_group_id":"exact-316bc4797f47","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"661190c68649591f3d26","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":94,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
